          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎగతాళి — egatāḷi — \"mockery; ridicule\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కొత్త అబ్బాయిని తరగతిలో ఎగతాళి చేశారు. kotta abbāyini taragatilō egatāḷi cēśāru. They made fun of the new boy in class."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎగతాళి (egatāḷi) చేయు, to make fun of."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎగతాళి (egatāḷi) is native Dravidian: DEDR 767 lists Telugu egatāḷi, \"a joke, mockery\", and marks Tamil ekattāḷi as taken from Telugu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
