          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నిలదీయు (niladīyu) is a native compound: nilucu, \"to stand, to stop\" (DEDR 3675), and tīyu, \"to draw, to pull\" (DEDR 3407): to pull someone up short."
            }
